      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The legendary Spruce Goose, the world’s largest aircraft, was assembled in Playa Vista’s hangar before its 1947 flight from Long Beach Harbor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
